  "description": "RIGXOW crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C93 H119 Dy3 N2 O17 S8 Zn1,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Zn1 (Zn) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.328-5.244 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 86.45-177.54°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C93H121N2O20S8ZnDy3. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 μ4-OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 2 OAc (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)). Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III).",
